<title>CHINA: China's Ningbo ITIC sets US$15 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>China's Ningbo ITIC sets US$15 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Ningbo International Trust and Investment Corp's US$15 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue is now in general syndication, bankers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER NINGBO INTERNATIONAL TRUST AND INVESTMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$15 MLN	COUPON    6ML+50    MATURITY  364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	     ISS PRICE PAR	 LAUNCHED  01.AUG.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	     CALLS     NONE	REPLIES   3 WKS</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	     REPAYMENT BULLET    DENOMS    US$100K</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	     SALE LMTS STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES		CRS DEF   YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY CHINA	   GOV LAW   ENGLISH   PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    LEAD MANAGERS  US$4-5 MLN 70 BP  ALL-IN 120 BP</p>
<p>	    MANAGERS	 US$2-3 MLN 60 BP  ALL-IN 110 BP</p>
<p> ARRANGER DKB ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES    THE DEAL IS SECURED BY LETTER OF COMFORT FROM NINGBO</p>
<p>	    MUNICIPAL PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENT</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
